!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/validate/valid/an-extern-of-a-subtype-selects-a-variant-of-an-externs-choice-target-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/validate-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §7.9, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4"
  description: """
    Where an extern's target is a choice, a tag at its position is admitted where it selects one of the variants as a
    tag at a choice does. `item_v1` names extern-family-1.tn's `( text | shape )`, and `circle_v1` reaches that
    schema's `circle`, IS-A `shape` alone: the tag selects the variant `shape`, and the value is read against
    `circle`.
    """
  valid: _
}
